@startuml ticketing-architecture
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam noteFontSize 11

title Ticketing Service Architecture

actor Client

component "Reservation\nService\n:8081" as R
component "Ticket\nService\n:8080" as T
component "Payment\nService\n:8082" as P

queue "Kafka" as K
queue ".DLT" as DLT

database "reservationDB" as RDB
database "ticketDB" as TDB
database "paymentDB" as PDB

' --- DB connections ---
R --> RDB : Reservation\n(status)
T --> TDB : Event, Seat\n(reserved)
P --> PDB : Payment\n(status, UNIQUE reservation_id)

' --- Main flow (Success) ---
Client --> R : 1. POST /api/reservations
R --> K : 2. reservation-requested\n(@AfterCommit)
K --> T : 3. reserve seat
K --> P : 4. process payment
P --> K : 5. payment-completed\n(@AfterCommit)
K --> R : 6. confirm reservation
R --> K : 7. reservation-confirmed\n(@AfterCommit)

' --- Compensation (Payment Failure) ---
P --> K : 5'. payment-failed
K --> R : 6'. cancel reservation
R --> K : 7'. reservation-cancelled
K --> T : 8. release seat\n[compensation]

' --- DLT ---
K --> DLT : retry exhausted\n(FixedBackOff 1s x 3)
DLT --> T : seat 재처리
DLT --> P : FAILED 저장\n+ 취소 이벤트 발행
DLT --> R : confirm/cancel 재처리

note right of DLT
  <b>Dead Letter Topic</b>
  각 서비스의 DltListener가
  .DLT 토픽을 소비하여 최종 처리
  (기존 서비스 로직 재사용, 멱등성 보장)
end note

note bottom of R
  <b>Choreography Saga</b>
  - 이벤트 기반 상태 전이
  - 실패 시 보상 트랜잭션
  - @TransactionalEventListener(AFTER_COMMIT)
  - 상태 기반 멱등성
end note

note bottom of P
  <b>Idempotency</b>
  - reservation_id UNIQUE (DB)
  - findByReservationId (App)
  - IllegalArgumentException만 catch
  - 시스템 예외 → 상위 전파 → DLT
end note

@enduml
